        "question_text": "<p>Find the coefficient of $x^3$ in the expansion of $(2x - 3)^5$.</p>",
        "question_image": null,
        "answer_image": null,
        "explanation": "<p>Using the binomial theorem, the general term in the expansion of $(2x - 3)^5$ is $\\binom{5}{k}(2x)^{5-k}(-3)^k$.<br><br>For the coefficient of $x^3$, set $5 - k = 3 \\Rightarrow k = 2$.<br><br>The term becomes $\\binom{5}{2}(2x)^3(-3)^2 = 10 \\cdot 8x^3 \\cdot 9 = 720x^3$.<br><br>The coefficient is $720$.</p>",
